<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 500 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 500 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    21.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE   S03.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.04    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    DUES	DENOMS (K) 1	   FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	IHS EMISSION 703</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
